WEBVTT

00:10:58.273 --> 00:11:00.332
Yay!

00:11:00.356 --> 00:11:09.398
(Applause)

00:11:09.422 --> 00:11:11.470
So that's pretty much what I do.

00:11:11.494 --> 00:11:13.126
I just love bringing technology together,

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:15.067
having a lot of fun, being creative.

00:11:15.091 --> 00:11:16.815
But it's not about the technology.

00:11:16.839 --> 00:11:19.679
It's just about, I want to create
some great experiences.

00:11:19.703 --> 00:11:21.079
So thank you very much.

00:11:21.103 --> 00:11:26.119
(Applause)